     2953       if not x-tog-wt       and i = 11  then  next.
     2954       if not x-tog-ms       and i = 12  then  next.
     2955       if not xDens          and i = 13  then  next.
     2956       assign
     2957         LL = LL + 1
     2958         l-nk = mp-1
     2959       .
     2960     if x-vat or i <> 2  then do:
     2961     if use-column[6]  then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , bi-ostatok-start                          [i] ,  i). end.
     2962     if use-column[7]  then do: l-nk = l-nk + 1 .    run ex-display in this-procedure  (mp-1 + ll + (kk * (l-nk - mp))  , bi-oborot-ie          [i] ,  i). end.
